        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in this game is to safely park your truck in uniquely designed parking areas, each offering different atmospheres and driving conditions. With a total of <strong>5 main themes and 90 levels</strong>, every stage increases in difficulty, testing both your patience and your driving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/0701657b8213f49c3583e5d2d475684c.poster.avif?t=1758043311\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/0701657b8213f49c3583e5d2d475684c.webm?t=1758043311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/0701657b8213f49c3583e5d2d475684c.mp4?t=1758043311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Container Yard : </strong>Navigate through tight spaces surrounded by massive containers. Find your trailer and maneuver carefully to reach the parking spot. Precision and control are the keys to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highway : </strong>Experience the pressure of parking alongside a busy highway. With fast-moving traffic nearby, you’ll need the perfect angle and flawless maneuvers. One wrong move could cost you the mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winter Scene : </strong>Snow-covered roads and slippery surfaces make control more challenging than ever. Successfully parking here proves your skills as a true professional driver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction Site : </strong>Towering cranes, moving machinery, and narrow passages await you. Stay alert and perform precise maneuvers to complete your task in this hectic environment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EV Semi Truck : </strong>Take the wheel of an electric truck! But beware—your battery is limited. Complete your parking mission before the charge runs out. Time management and quick decision-making will be crucial.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/6d1138138aca9d86b663b210c91c16a8.poster.avif?t=1758043311\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/6d1138138aca9d86b663b210c91c16a8.webm?t=1758043311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/6d1138138aca9d86b663b210c91c16a8.mp4?t=1758043311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each theme introduces its own unique challenges, pushing you to improve different skills. The right angle, patient maneuvers, and careful driving are the only way to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready? Get behind the wheel, find your trailer, and prove your parking skills!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in this game is to safely park your truck in uniquely designed parking areas, each offering different atmospheres and driving conditions. With a total of <strong>5 main themes and 90 levels</strong>, every stage increases in difficulty, testing both your patience and your driving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/0701657b8213f49c3583e5d2d475684c.poster.avif?t=1758043311\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/0701657b8213f49c3583e5d2d475684c.webm?t=1758043311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/0701657b8213f49c3583e5d2d475684c.mp4?t=1758043311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Container Yard : </strong>Navigate through tight spaces surrounded by massive containers. Find your trailer and maneuver carefully to reach the parking spot. Precision and control are the keys to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highway : </strong>Experience the pressure of parking alongside a busy highway. With fast-moving traffic nearby, you’ll need the perfect angle and flawless maneuvers. One wrong move could cost you the mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winter Scene : </strong>Snow-covered roads and slippery surfaces make control more challenging than ever. Successfully parking here proves your skills as a true professional driver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction Site : </strong>Towering cranes, moving machinery, and narrow passages await you. Stay alert and perform precise maneuvers to complete your task in this hectic environment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EV Semi Truck : </strong>Take the wheel of an electric truck! But beware—your battery is limited. Complete your parking mission before the charge runs out. Time management and quick decision-making will be crucial.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/6d1138138aca9d86b663b210c91c16a8.poster.avif?t=1758043311\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/6d1138138aca9d86b663b210c91c16a8.webm?t=1758043311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977750/extras/6d1138138aca9d86b663b210c91c16a8.mp4?t=1758043311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each theme introduces its own unique challenges, pushing you to improve different skills. The right angle, patient maneuvers, and careful driving are the only way to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready? Get behind the wheel, find your trailer, and prove your parking skills!</strong></p>",
